ame are simple. Each player is given a random set of cards that are objects/phrases. At the start of each round, a judge is selected along with a random card, an adjective. Your goal? Select a card that you think the judge will pair with their card to win! 🏆\n\nWith 1500+ different game cards and various game modes, you are sure to come up with crazy card combinations and have endless hours of fun! At least 3 players in a server are needed to play. 🎮\n\nWith full device cross compatibility, you can play the game on the go on your phone or tablet. Your cards and win stats also save between all devices and servers. Private servers are free to rent to play specifically with your friends! 📱","path":"/game/3121370344-pears-to-pairs-card-game","slug":"3121370344-pears-to-pairs-card-game","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0781d64aee64f850f30812b3483b7084/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/5c5d8bfdf1d8e1b5a86ce24555e1a8e6/150/150/Image/Jpeg","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":32268977,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-09-23T03:08:28.249Z","creator":{"name":"Pears to Pairs Development","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":746820961,"name":"Unit 1968","desc":"Semi-realistic Vietnam War-themed shooter that takes inspiration from Day of Infamy and Battlefield 1\n\nStarted development on 10 / 1 / 2016","path":"/game/746820961-unit-1968","slug":"746820961-unit-1968","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ca07ed09e57e3a608afd9f43082d2cd0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0c5ee8d31c0a5f30e5882c22aa292664/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":52420854,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-25T20:54:13.199Z","creator":{"name":"ROLVe","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2622527242,"name":"SCP rBreach (Classic)","desc":"Here for nostalgia? Check out the new release! : https://www.